{An extra & here is so disastrous that you should probably exit^^J
and fix things up.}
\newdimen\eqnshift@
\newdimen\alignsep@
\newdimen\tagshift@
\newcommand{\mintagsep}{.5\fontdimen6\textfont\tw@}
\newcommand{\minalignsep}{10pt}
\newdimen\tagwidth@
