    This~should~not~happen.~#1 \\
    Please~report~at~https://github.com/latex3/latex2e.
  }
\msg_new:nnn { hooks } { activate-disabled }
  {
    Cannot~ activate~ hook~ '#1'~ because~ it~ is~ disabled!
