    { Property~'#1'~ has~ already~ been~ declared. }
    { There~ already~ exists~ a~ property~ declaration~ with~ this~
      name.\\
      Please~ use~ a~ different~ name~ for~ your~ property.}

\msg_new:nnnn { property } { not-declared }
  { Property~'#1'~not~declared. }
